Write a program in Unleashed Pascal that demonstrates asynchronous processing. The program should start three asynchronous tasks that each compute the sum of integers from 1 to a different limit (100, 200, and 300). After starting all tasks, await their results and print them in the order the tasks were started. Use inline variables for the task handles and results.
